[HR]
[SIZE=4][B]What’s new[/B][/SIZE]

[B]Admin economy[/B]
[LIST]
[*][ICODE]/bc token add <player> <amount>[/ICODE] — grant tokens (online or known offline)
[*][ICODE]/bc xp add <player> <amount>[/ICODE] — grant XP (existing stats level curve)
[*]Perms: [ICODE]bedlam.token.add[/ICODE] · [ICODE]bedlam.xp.add[/ICODE] (default op; under [ICODE]bedlam.admin[/ICODE])
[*]Console may run [ICODE]token[/ICODE] / [ICODE]xp[/ICODE] (same as [ICODE]reload[/ICODE])
[/LIST]

[B]Paper 26.2 world border[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Setup border hide no longer uses diameter [ICODE]6e7[/ICODE] (Paper rejected it — could crash [B]Cancel[/B] / [B]Apply[/B])
[*]Diameters clamped to Paper’s max ([ICODE]59_999_968[/ICODE])
[*]Cancel / Apply border restore guarded so a bad size cannot leave orphan setup state
[/LIST]

[HR]
